{"id":"c46a4f13f0281f9b","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-top7-sequentially-compact-space.md","title":"ZFC Top7 Sequentially Compact Space","display":"df-zfc-top7-sequentially-compact-space — ZFC Top7 Sequentially Compact Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top7-sequentially-compact-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top7-sequentially-compact-space"],"display":"df-zfc-top7-sequentially-compact-space — ZFC Top7 Sequentially Compact Space","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-top-convergence-sequence.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top7-sequentially-compact-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top7-sequentially-compact-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top7-sequentially-compact-space — ZFC Top7 Sequentially Compact Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"91dfddd12189e300\" href=\"?note=91dfddd12189e300\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-top-convergence-sequence.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-top-convergence-sequence.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopConvergenceSequence}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopConvergenceSequence}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop7SequentiallyCompactSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop7SequentiallyCompactSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top7\\text{-}sequentially\\text{-}compact\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop7SequentiallyCompactSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall s\\;\\bigl((s:\\omega\\to X)\\to\\exists t\\;\\exists x\\in X\\;(t:\\omega\\to\\omega\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(m&lt;n\\to t(m)&lt;t(n))\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTopConvergenceSequence}_S(s\\circ t,x,X,\\tau))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top7\\text{-}sequentially\\text{-}compact\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop7SequentiallyCompactSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall s\\;\\bigl((s:\\omega\\to X)\\to\\exists t\\;\\exists x\\in X\\;(t:\\omega\\to\\omega\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(m&lt;n\\to t(m)&lt;t(n))\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTopConvergenceSequence}_S(s\\circ t,x,X,\\tau))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>严格递增的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(t:\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span> 选出子序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\circ t\">\\(s\\circ t\\)</span>；每个序列都存在这样的收敛子序列正是序列紧致性。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"li